                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "It was an honor to participate in today's groundbreaking at Freedom's Path Waco. This project, located at the Doris Miller VA Medical Center in Waco, will redevelop and construct permanent supportive housing for the city's veteran community. I am committed to Freedom's Path Waco's mission of supporting veterans through their challenges. It is our turn to give back to those who have served our country.",
