                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today, I had the opportunity to speak with physicians at the Doctor's Forum Fly-In hosted by the Market Institute. Providers and recipients of care alike recognize that there needs to be proper reform in our health care system. Doctors are on the front lines, facing critical challenges that lawmakers must urgently address. Their perspective is valuable and I appreciate them taking the time to visit Washington and have these conversations.",
