                "text": "Great to participate in today\u2019s first hearing in the @GOPoversight Subcommittee on Health Care and Financial Services. We need to work to ensure fairness in welfare programs for all Americans. Looking forward to continuing in this important work with the Subcommittee. https://t.co/dZBcAJhrNQ",
